# Generation of EDM maps for visualizing clusters requires Xplor-NIH, version > 2.9
# The maps can be regenerated by running atomProb_cluster*_bbonly.py
# in their respective data_folder/xplor/cluster* folders, using pyXplor or xplor -py
# Cluster names are zero-indexed, i.e. files named 'cluster0' are the closed cluster in the text,
# Files named 'cluster1' are the open cluster in the text.
# Finally, RMSD distributions for panels A/B can be recreated with:
./plot_RMSD_distribs.py
